        "reason": "The source supports the limited draft for Algorithm 1. Its inputs are the per-request (m_i,p_i,d_i) tuples and the capacities M_P and M_D, all known in advance for a batch released at t=0. Its returned output is the per-request prefill and decode admission times. The LP solution and the dyadic groups are correctly marked intermediate, and decode admission does reserve peak decode demand h_i. The alpha<1 and beta<1 applicability condition and the feasibility assumptions are stated in the source. Truncation of the remaining pseudocode is acknowledged as an explicit unknown. This acceptance covers only this draft; it does not establish curation, executability or novelty.",
