        "reason": "Most ports match Algorithm 2 (A_min): memory capacity M, lower bounds, intermediate lower-bound updates applied only on cancellation, and the returned processing sequence. However, the draft omits the explicitly listed prompt-size input. It also labels the contract a batch-formation step even though the returned output and the update port come from the whole loop, including eviction.",
